      "releaseNotes": "You can now pinch-zoom into the illustrations in the introduction, and the main map key is now large and easier to read as well. We've fixed an issue where the widget would show birds that you had hidden using the region filtering option in the settings, and have updated many Norwegian names.\n\nFor Identify subscribers we've improved the audio identification AI model and made some changes to the similar songs and calls.",
      "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 3.72441,
